# Electron 二进制（@electron/get）与 electron-builder 辅助二进制默认从 GitHub Releases
# 下载，国内网络常报 “Client network socket disconnected before secure TLS connection
# was established”。这里固定走 npmmirror 镜像（不改动 npm registry，npm audit 仍可用官方源）。
